  "description": "Soliton in a tight periodic lattice — potential period short, depth moderate. The wave trapped in the crystal's band structure. Narrow width, low velocity. The electron localized by the periodic potential, behaving like a tight-binding hopping model. Each note is a discrete quantum jump between lattice sites.",
